%
(Production TCPC G49.1 guard smoke check)
(Expected result: program aborts at G49.1 while B/C are away from entry.)
(Run only at safe no-cut clearance, homed, machine enabled, near B0 C0.)

G17 G21 G40 G49 G54 G64 P0.001 G80 G90 G92.1 G94
F300

#<smoke_tool> = #<_current_tool>
o090 if [#<smoke_tool> LT 1]
  (abort, G49 guard smoke requires a loaded tool so G43 Hn can be active before G43.4)
o090 endif
G43 H#<smoke_tool>
#<selected_tool_length_z> = #5403
o091 if [ABS[#<selected_tool_length_z>] LT 0.001]
  (abort, G49 guard smoke expected selected tool to have nonzero Z length)
o091 endif

#<start_b_check> = #<_hal[headheadtwp.current_joint_b]>
#<start_c_check> = #<_hal[headheadtwp.current_joint_c]>
o080 while [#<start_b_check> GT 180.0]
  #<start_b_check> = [#<start_b_check> - 360.0]
o080 endwhile
o081 while [#<start_b_check> LT -180.0]
  #<start_b_check> = [#<start_b_check> + 360.0]
o081 endwhile
o082 while [#<start_c_check> GT 180.0]
  #<start_c_check> = [#<start_c_check> - 360.0]
o082 endwhile
o083 while [#<start_c_check> LT -180.0]
  #<start_c_check> = [#<start_c_check> + 360.0]
o083 endwhile

o084 if [ABS[#<start_b_check>] GT 0.05]
  (abort, G49 guard smoke must start near B0)
o084 endif
o085 if [ABS[#<start_c_check>] GT 0.05]
  (abort, G49 guard smoke must start near C0)
o085 endif

o100 if [#<_hal[headheadtwp.tcpc_enabled]> GT 0.5]
  (abort, G49 guard smoke must start with TCPC off)
o100 endif
o101 if [#<_hal[headheadtwp.motion_enabled]> GT 0.5]
  (abort, G49 guard smoke must start with TWP motion off)
o101 endif

G0 B0.0 C0.0

G43.4
o110 if [#<_hal[headheadtwp.tcpc_enabled]> LT 0.5]
  (abort, G43.4 did not enable TCPC)
o110 endif

G0 B5.0 C5.0

(The next line must be rejected by the production remap.)
G49.1

(If this line executes, the guard failed.)
(abort, G49.1 guard failed; TCPC exited away from entry B/C)
%
